---
---
<figure class="karatsuba-hero" aria-labelledby="karatsuba-hero-caption">
  <div class="hero-top">
    <div>
      <p class="hero-eyebrow">Une idée d’algorithmique · 1962</p>
      <p class="hero-statement">Multiplier autrement.</p>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">À chaque découpage, Karatsuba remplace quatre multiplications de blocs par trois. Le schéma montre ce qui change — et ce qui ne change pas.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-count" aria-label="Quatre produits deviennent trois">
      <span>4</span><i>→</i><strong>3</strong>
      <small>multiplications de blocs</small>
    </div>
  </div>

  <svg class="karatsuba-diagram" viewBox="0 0 820 390" role="img" aria-labelledby="karatsuba-diagram-title karatsuba-diagram-desc">
    <title id="karatsuba-diagram-title">De quatre produits partiels à trois produits avec Karatsuba</title>
    <desc id="karatsuba-diagram-desc">Les nombres 1 234 et 5 678 sont découpés en 12, 34, 56 et 78. La méthode directe calcule ac, ad, bc et bd. Karatsuba calcule ac, bd et le produit des sommes (a+b)(c+d), puis soustrait ac et bd pour retrouver ad+bc.</desc>
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="karatsuba-flow-gradient" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#60d4bf" />
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#8eacff" />
      </linearGradient>
      <linearGradient id="karatsuba-result-gradient" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#176b6d" />
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#315c72" />
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <rect class="diagram-panel" x="8" y="8" width="804" height="374" rx="22" />
    <text class="diagram-number" x="410" y="48" text-anchor="middle">1 234 × 5 678</text>
    <text class="diagram-caption" x="410" y="72" text-anchor="middle">DÉCOUPER : (12 × 100 + 34) × (56 × 100 + 78)</text>

    <g class="diagram-direct">
      <text class="diagram-section-label" x="410" y="112" text-anchor="middle">DÉVELOPPEMENT DIRECT · 4 PRODUITS</text>
      <path class="diagram-branch" d="M410 82 V126 M112 126 H708 M112 126 V145 M310 126 V145 M510 126 V145 M708 126 V145" />
      <g class="diagram-product common-product">
        <rect x="36" y="147" width="152" height="58" rx="10" />
        <text x="112" y="172" text-anchor="middle">ac</text><text class="diagram-small" x="112" y="190" text-anchor="middle">12 × 56</text>
      </g>
      <g class="diagram-product cross-product">
        <rect x="234" y="147" width="152" height="58" rx="10" />
        <text x="310" y="172" text-anchor="middle">ad</text><text class="diagram-small" x="310" y="190" text-anchor="middle">12 × 78</text>
      </g>
      <g class="diagram-product cross-product">
        <rect x="434" y="147" width="152" height="58" rx="10" />
        <text x="510" y="172" text-anchor="middle">bc</text><text class="diagram-small" x="510" y="190" text-anchor="middle">34 × 56</text>
      </g>
      <g class="diagram-product common-product">
        <rect x="632" y="147" width="152" height="58" rx="10" />
        <text x="708" y="172" text-anchor="middle">bd</text><text class="diagram-small" x="708" y="190" text-anchor="middle">34 × 78</text>
      </g>
    </g>

    <path class="diagram-transition" d="M410 218 V250" />
    <path class="diagram-transition-arrow" d="M401 241 L410 251 L419 241" />
    <text class="diagram-section-label diagram-karatsuba-label" x="410" y="275" text-anchor="middle">KARATSUBA · 3 PRODUITS</text>
    <g class="diagram-karatsuba-products">
      <rect class="diagram-pill common-pill" x="54" y="291" width="190" height="48" rx="10" />
      <text x="149" y="320" text-anchor="middle">p = ac</text>
      <rect class="diagram-pill common-pill" x="315" y="291" width="190" height="48" rx="10" />
      <text x="410" y="320" text-anchor="middle">q = bd</text>
      <rect class="diagram-pill auxiliary-pill" x="576" y="291" width="190" height="48" rx="10" />
      <text x="671" y="320" text-anchor="middle">r = (a+b)(c+d)</text>
    </g>
    <text class="diagram-equation" x="410" y="365" text-anchor="middle">ad + bc = r − p − q</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption id="karatsuba-hero-caption">Les deux méthodes reconstruisent exactement le même produit. Karatsuba ne supprime pas le terme croisé : il le déduit d’un produit auxiliaire et de deux produits déjà calculés.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .karatsuba-hero { --kh-ink:#eef9fa; --kh-muted:#c4d5dc; margin:1.4rem 0 2.6rem; padding:clamp(1rem,3vw,2rem); border-radius:1.15rem; overflow:hidden; color:var(--kh-ink); background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 88% 0%,#244f65 0,transparent 45%),linear-gradient(135deg,#102c43,#193b57 70%,#16364c); box-shadow:0 18px 42px rgba(25,59,87,.15); }
  .karatsuba-hero * { box-sizing:border-box; }
  .hero-top { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap:1.5rem; align-items:end; padding-bottom:1.35rem; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(226,245,247,.2); }
  .hero-eyebrow,.hero-count small { margin:0; color:#80d8c9; font:600 .65rem/1.4 "DM Mono",monospace; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .hero-statement { margin:.45rem 0 .35rem; color:var(--kh-ink); font:500 clamp(2rem,5vw,3.6rem)/.98 "Newsreader",Georgia,serif; letter-spacing:-.045em; }
  .hero-subtitle { max-width:42rem; margin:0; color:#c4d5dc; font:.93rem/1.55 "DM Sans",sans-serif; }
  .hero-count { display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto auto auto; align-items:center; column-gap:.35rem; text-align:center; white-space:nowrap; }
  .hero-count span,.hero-count strong { font:500 clamp(2.8rem,6vw,4.6rem)/.85 "Newsreader",Georgia,serif; }
  .hero-count span { color:#d1e1e6; }.hero-count i { color:#60d4bf; font:400 2rem "DM Sans",sans-serif; }.hero-count strong { color:#8eacff; }
  .hero-count small { grid-column:1/-1; margin-top:.5rem; color:#c4d5dc; font-size:.57rem; letter-spacing:.08em; }
  .karatsuba-diagram { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; margin:1.35rem auto .3rem; overflow:visible; }
  .diagram-panel { fill:#193b57; stroke:#3d6479; stroke-width:1.5; }
  .diagram-number { fill:#eef9fa; font:700 25px "DM Mono",monospace; }
  .diagram-caption { fill:#a9c7d1; font:11px "DM Mono",monospace; }
  .diagram-section-label { fill:#a9c7d1; font:600 11px "DM Mono",monospace; letter-spacing:1.2px; }
  .diagram-branch { fill:none; stroke:#6d9aaa; stroke-width:1.7; }
  .diagram-product rect { stroke-width:1.4; }
  .diagram-product text { fill:#f4fbfc; font:600 17px "DM Mono",monospace; }
  .diagram-product .diagram-small { fill:#bcd3dc; font:11px "DM Sans",sans-serif; font-weight:400; }
  .common-product rect { fill:#285c68; stroke:#65b6a8; }
  .cross-product rect { fill:#654f45; stroke:#d3a46d; }
  .diagram-transition { fill:none; stroke:url(#karatsuba-flow-gradient); stroke-width:2.7; stroke-linecap:round; }
  .diagram-transition-arrow { fill:none; stroke:#8eacff; stroke-width:2.7; stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round; }
  .diagram-karatsuba-label { fill:#80d8c9; }
  .diagram-pill { stroke-width:1.4; }
  .common-pill { fill:#285c68; stroke:#65b6a8; }
  .auxiliary-pill { fill:#4f4b70; stroke:#8eacff; }
  .diagram-karatsuba-products text { fill:#f4fbfc; font:600 16px "DM Mono",monospace; }
  .diagram-equation { fill:#9de6d8; font:600 15px "DM Mono",monospace; }
  .karatsuba-hero figcaption { margin:.65rem .2rem 0; color:#c4d5dc; font:.72rem/1.55 "DM Sans",sans-serif; }
  @media(max-width:650px) {
    .hero-top { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:1rem; }
    .hero-count { justify-self:start; }
    .karatsuba-diagram { min-width:560px; max-width:none; width:100%; }
    .karatsuba-hero { overflow-x:auto; }
    .karatsuba-hero figcaption { min-width:0; }
  }
</style>